{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Wild is a cosy relaxing nature game where you grow real-life plants and trees to attract wildlife.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll join the Grow Wild Nature Club and travel the globe transforming empty landscapes into thriving biodiverse ecosystems using real ecological principles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The exuberant Professor Vicky Sponge will guide you on your adventure across 5 biomes as you rewild 15 diverse landscapes, discover 300 species, and witness how small actions grow into lasting ecological change and climate stability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll look at lizards, pick up pine cones, balance biomes, photograph falcons, sow seeds, trim trees, follow a frog, hide in a bush, surprise a snake, wait for a weasel, chat about chiff chaffs, and experience the magic, joy, and wonder of the natural world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/2285253fcc54c1c3c3faa06c90513601.avif?t=1772545030\" width=800 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for bees buzzing in foxglove, crows nesting high in ash trees, moths fluttering in the dark, snakes hiding under rocks, or spiders weaving webs in tall grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/1e1c9dc4c072e9ad2d2378adef10d134.avif?t=1772545030\" width=800 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know every plant and creature in your nature book, understand what they need to thrive, and see how they fit into the wider ecosystem and food web.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/2764f858901b1fc3339af1d07212aca7.avif?t=1772545030\" width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forage for seeds and start growing habitats \u2014 plant wildflowers, build log piles, and create the perfect conditions to welcome new wildlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OBSERVE<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/fed51c3b553bcaaf560f120cd4c8801e.avif?t=1772545030\" width=800 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back and relax as your ecosystem comes to life - even when you\u2019re not playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Simulated Ecosystem</strong> - Everything in the game is simulated and interconnected, from thousands of sun rays changing tree growth, nectar levels in flowers, animal life cycles, seasons, weather systems, and day night cycles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Peaceful Sandbox Experience</strong> - Create thriving habitats at your own pace, however you choose</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent World</strong> - Your habitats evolve and grow even when you\u2019re not playing. The game time is 100x faster than real-world time, so if you come back one day later 100 days will have passed in the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-World Species</strong> - Discover and learn about over 300 plants and animals within 5 biomes - each with unique needs and behaviours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by Real-Life Nature Conservation</strong> - This game is created by Philip Sinclair who has been growing and building real wildlife habitats for over 15 years in the UK countryside</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for learning</strong>\u00a0- Strongly aligned with school science learning objectives - teaching biodiversity and ecosystems through play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Someone called Sid</strong> - A fellow nature fan who\u2019s always nearby to help - or accidentally scare off a butterfly you\u2019re about to identify!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/6171da1bf196dad27414e10db993e1e1.avif?t=1772545030\" width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3230260?t=1772545030","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/e9fe1f8854e71e7fea34607a44f624e61f3d6d60/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772545030","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/4bd150834fdca6509866f7f66c7bc34bf8c9c108/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772545030","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/4bd150834fdca6509866f7f66c7bc34bf8c9c108/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772545030","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Wild is a cosy relaxing nature game where you grow real-life plants and trees t