igned with school science learning objectives - teaching biodiversity and ecosystems through play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Someone called Sid</strong> - A fellow nature fan who\u2019s always nearby to help - or accidentally scare off a butterfly you\u2019re about to identify!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/6171da1bf196dad27414e10db993e1e1.avif?t=1772545030\" width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>","developers":["SPECTRUM48"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/41efa11afc245a5f8c194474c5f5b4fc90fee46a/header.jpg?t=1772545030","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 SPECTRUM48 Ltd 2025","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3230260/824102472/ed66c8f0bf6c429f63f10ac39f6e38e1ace466a0/1772454849/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772540187","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3230260/824102472/ed66c8f0bf6c429f63f10ac39f6e38e1ace466a0/1772454849/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772540187","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3230260/824102472/ed66c8f0bf6c429f63f10ac39f6e38e1ace466a0/1772454849/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772540187","id":257296649,"name":"Demo Trailer 2026","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257296649/20ba433a7d7986a6bc9e0eecf6c433e764d2acd2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1772540187"}],"name":"Grow Wild","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-6700K<br></li><li><stro